      "code": "DY5si4Ujw15",
      "caption": "I had a special Respect visit yesterday at @we.are.parkrose. ❤️\n\nIt was an honor to surprise the Parkrose Senior class during their “Decision Day” celebration. I was inspired hearing students share their plans for college and their next chapters. \n\nI was able to share the story of my own journey leaving for college and embracing new experiences…and the importance of continuing to Show Up, Work Hard, and Be Kind through every stage of life.\n\nCongrats to the Senior class! 💪🏽\n\n📸 @bruceely\n🎥 @tatianamarie_",
