      "caption": "Show Up. Work Hard. Be Kind. ❤️\n\nI had a great day at @cesar.chavez.k8.school with the newest Respect program students. It was an honor to speak with the 6th, 7th, and 8th graders about leadership, kindness, accountability, and what Respect looks like every day.\n\nShoutout to the students recognized for respectful behavior! Always fun ending the visit with a free throw contest and a “clap out” with the K-5th grade students. 👏🏽\n\n🎥 @thebrilliantlewis \n📸 @bruceely",
